ed REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  addition axillary tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tissue with one lymph node  submitted in R  Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   BREAST LEFT   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  James Kirby  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LEFT BREAST MASS PART B  LEFT AXILLA TISSUE PART C  LEFT AXILLA CONTENTS   report_end  , Unchecked.
