g REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  Also in the same container is a piece of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  SECTION CODES  A D  Biopsy cavity with fibrotic area around  with B containing cavity closest to the deep margin  E F  Nodular area medial to biopsy cavity  G H  Normal parenchyma  I   Skin with scar  J   Sentinel lymph node  bisected  K   Fatty tissue received with sentinel lymph node  L M  Biopsy cavity  N O  Nipple  Resident  SHABIN NANJI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Steven Michael Abbate  M D  David R Whittaker  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL    EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
