remarkable adipose tissue interspersed with dense fibrous connective tissue  Note that sectioning beneath the first mentioned healing scar reveals no discrete abnormalities  The axillary tag is dissected and numerous lymph nodes are identified ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  Section Code  A B  lesion with closest margin  skin_   C F  biospy cavity  G  representative sections of discoloration near axillary tail  H N  representative sections of lymph nodes  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left axilla lesion  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm tan skin ellipse with a central REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm irregular gray white mottled lesion within 0 1cm of the nearest margin  Ends in O  body in P R  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  SKIN LESION  LEFT AXILLA   report_end  , Unchecked.
