at failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 22 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast lesion  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fibrofatty tissue fragment oriented with sutures  The short suture indicating superior margin  long suture indicating lateral margin  and two sutures indicating medial margin  The specimen is inked and sectioned under Dr  Gadd s supervision to reveal tan white firm area in the inferior medial aspect  The specimen is received in the back bench  and an irregular white mass in the inferior medial aspect measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  The mass comes to within less than 0 1cm of the anterior margin  The mass also comes to within 0 1cm of the deep margin  There is an area of firm white fibrous tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm extending to within 1 4cm of the anterior margin  Section Code  A C  representative sections of mass with anterior closest margin  D E  representative sections of mass with closest deep margin  F  representative section of fibrotic area with closest margin  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
